commercial. This permission expands what you may do and adds no restriction to
CC BY 4.0.

Attribution is still required on republication — when the data or content
itself is made available to others as a resource in its own right. The test:
if a third party can obtain the data AS DATA from what you distribute, that is
republication, and CC BY 4.0 attribution applies.

